      "id": "DE-KURZ-AUFHEB-002",
      "sourceSection": "4.7",
      "kind": "RESTORE_ORIGINAL_BASE_OR_FULL_MEANING",
      "summary": "When a sign or sign sequence must retain its original meaning, Punkt 6 is prefixed. It cancels the additional Kurzschrift meaning and restores the original Basis- or Vollschrift meaning.",
